Title:  Went down to the crossroads

Seq:    6.25.1.1

Level:  5 - Detail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Johnson, Robert|Robert Johnson]], 1996, from *[[Complete Recordings]]*

Body:

I went down to the Crossroads, tried to catch a ride.\
I went down to the Crossroads, tried to catch a ride.\
But nobody seemed to know me.\
Everybody just passed me by.
